### Describe the bug

When certain errors, like ["ResizeObserver loop completed with undelivered notifications"](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/ResizeObserver#observation_errors)  happen, `null` is printed to stderr with absolutely no clues about what's going on. 

