Personally, not a big fan of that idea. Projects are not the same as package managers workspaces. For example, they run in the same process, unlike the workspace. The workspace glob also has different semantics in Vitest so we would have to align with every package manager. Some package managers do not use JSON for their workspace setting, like `pnpm` that uses `yaml`, and bringing a yaml parses just for an edge cases doesn't seem worth it.

